DSL 1
# The word frequencies of a course pack (courses-biome/<pair>/frequency.core-data), one FREQ row per lemma in rank order. A contract and a step of
# their own: nothing refers to them and the 1000 printed rows should not sit in the file of the course rows (R1Design.md D1).
RECORD FrequencyRow COUNT 1..
  rank: int
  lemma: string
  count: int
END
